      "message": "Sure, I will separate the conditions, one is to return -EINVAL and the other to return -EPERM for pVM.\n\nMaybe to save the check `max_isr !\u003d -1`, I prefer to add `if (max_isr \u003d\u003d -1)` and jump to the update if this is true, so that the reset conditions doesn\u0027t need to have `max_isr !\u003d -1`.",
